---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Rental Market Analysis Ghana — Comparable Rent Research | PRC" description="Market research report on comparable rental rates in your Ghana location and property type — data-driven rent-setting support.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Rental Market Analysis Report</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Market research report on comparable rental rates in your location, property type, and tenure — data-driven positioning for confident rent-setting.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">The housing market changes constantly. What you charged 2 years ago may no longer be competitive. Setting rent without knowing the market means:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li><strong>Too low:</strong> You leave thousands in cedis on the table</li>
          <li><strong>Too high:</strong> No tenants apply, your unit sits vacant</li>
          <li><strong>No justification:</strong> Tenant challenges rent at Rent Control with no market data to counter</li>
          <li><strong>Guessing:</strong> You're competing with neighbors but don't know their rates</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>This report gives you market data to set rent confidently and defensibly.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's in the Report</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Market Overview:</strong> Current rental rates in your location and property type</li>
          <li><strong>Comparable Properties:</strong> Details on 8–12 similar properties in your area with their rents</li>
          <li><strong>Price Range Analysis:</strong> Low, median, high rents for your property type</li>
          <li><strong>Amenity Pricing:</strong> How much each amenity (parking, water, DSTV) adds to market rent</li>
          <li><strong>Your Property Positioning:</strong> Where your property fits in the market</li>
          <li><strong>Recommended Rent Range:</strong> Evidence-based rent recommendation</li>
          <li><strong>Market Trends:</strong> Are rents rising or falling in your area?</li>
          <li><strong>Defensibility:</strong> Documentation you can show to tenant or Rent Control</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">How We Research</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Active listings on rental platforms (Jumia, Whatsapp, local agents)</li>
          <li>Recently rented properties in your area</li>
          <li>Real estate agent insights from your neighborhood</li>
          <li>Published market reports for Ghana</li>
          <li>Property type and location-specific analysis</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You're setting rent on a new property and want to position it correctly</li>
          <li>You're increasing rent and want market justification</li>
          <li>You suspect your current rent is too low</li>
          <li>A tenant is challenging your rent and you need comparable data</li>
          <li>You're buying an investment property and want to know its rental potential</li>
          <li>You have multiple properties and want pricing consistency across them</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The Real Value</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">If your market rent is GHS 50 higher per month than you're currently charging, a report at GHS 500–1,000 pays for itself in a single month of increased rent. Over a year, it's the difference between GHS 600 in report cost and thousands in additional income.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 500 – 1,000</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Depends on location complexity and property type specificity</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Turnaround: 3–5 working days (includes research + analysis + report)</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
